                        ],
                        "form": "martialers"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "361bf4f2-fe6e-3cc1-b21f-54b37f7f28c9",
                        "entry_id": "230c80a2-4fd9-3daa-8587-f6539bd11aeb",
                        "glosses": [
                            "betrekking hebbend op het leger"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "810a0b6c-de38-4f8b-93e2-f65ba30e43f4",
                                "sense_id": "361bf4f2-fe6e-3cc1-b21f-54b37f7f28c9",
                                "text": "Maar zoals bij zoveel zaken die eigenlijk het daglicht niet kunnen verdragen - perverse porno, gejatte muziek en films - biedt de computer ook voor de martiaal aangelegde mens uitkomst. Wie de behoefte heeft om na een dag op kantoor kwistig met handgranaten in het rond te strooien, kan kiezen uit een oneindige reeks oorlogsspellen die de laatste tijd op de markt is gebracht."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "7b299c50-e680-38b1-9a49-e8c224f3ce3c",
                        "entry_id": "230c80a2-4fd9-3daa-8587-f6539bd11aeb",
                        "glosses": [
                            "krijgshaftig"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "fa6b0f0c-ec2e-4c99-943a-0d48776ed363",
                                "sense_id": "7b299c50-e680-38b1-9a49-e8c224f3ce3c",
                                "text": "Aan de andere kant van het bad was een groepje geëmancipeerde, Tsjechische vrouwen van rond de dertig, nostalgisch naar hun figuur van vóór hun zwangerschap, vreemde bewegingen aan het maken in het water. Ik vermoed dat men dat wateraerobic noemt. In het begin was het erg rustig, armen en benen op en neer bewegen, drijven met een schuimrubberen slang, maar dan plots gingen ze volledig wild. Ze begonnen rituele cirkels te draaien in een kring, maakten een treintje zoals op elke foute fuif en stampten martiaal met hun voeten in het water. Ik moest mijn hand gebruiken om mijn mond weer toe te klappen."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "fafef132-6198-47d6-b085-0d7b0d09d2b2",
                                "sense_id": "7b299c50-e680-38b1-9a49-e8c224f3ce3c",
                                "text": "Gisteren konden wij 'meevechten' via de Tour du ALS op de Mont Ventoux: 'Samen trappen we ALS de wereld uit.' Reclamebureaus houden nu eenmaal van woordspelingen. Als ik aan fietsen op de Mont Ventoux denk, is echter mijn eerste associatie de gelijknamige dichtbundel van Jan Kal, die veertig jaar geleden verscheen. En bij ALS denk ik niet aan martiaal gedrag, maar aan Pieter Steinz, die aan deze ziekte lijdt en tot het laatst probeert door te schrijven over wat hij de moeite waard vindt."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "07276d57-01b2-4913-8a12-4720b4ca2cc4",
                        "source_entry_id": "230c80a2-4fd9-3daa-8587-f6539bd11aeb",
                        "source_sense_id": "361bf4f2-fe6e-3cc1-b21f-54b37f7f28c9",
                        "source_sense_description": "(militair) betrekking hebbend op het leger",
                        "target_lang_word": "military",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "military",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "cc998d76-4915-3189-9f8d-3ab6f10bd541",
                                        "entry_id": "9ad587ca-ff49-3c6c-87a7-7e773eef42f3",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Characteristic of members of the armed forces."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "not-comparable",
                                            "usually"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "742a776d-2a7f-4293-bd95-246b413d9344",
                                                "sense_id": "cc998d76-4915-3189-9f8d-3ab6f10bd541",
                                                "text": "She was dishonorably discharged from all military duties."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "705464da-93d6-4a9f-a502-c01f497af53b",
                                                "sense_id": "cc998d76-4915-3189-9f8d-3ab6f10bd541",
                                                "text": "\"My dear fellow, I know you well. I know the military neatness which characterises you. You shave every morning, and in this season you shave by the sunlight; but since your shaving is less and less complete as we get farther back on the left side, until it becomes positively slovenly as we get round the angle of the jaw, it is surely very clear that that side is less illuminated than the other. I could not imagine a man of your habits looking at himself in an equal light and being satisfied with such a result.\""
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "73792b5a-55d1-4ccc-82ae-ccf8c2056a6b",
                                                "sense_id": "cc998d76-4915-3189-9f8d-3ab6f10bd541",
                                                "text": "At her invitation he outlined for her the succeeding chapters with terse military accuracy ; and what she liked best and best understood was avoidance of that false modesty which condescends, turning technicality into pabulum."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "92cb9e6c-34b1-4ae5-b90e-a94bf64160d6",
                                                "sense_id": "cc998d76-4915-3189-9f8d-3ab6f10bd541",
                                                "text": "Poirot was an extraordinary looking little man. He was hardly more than five feet, four inches, but carried himself with great dignity. His head was exactly the shape of an egg, and he always perched it a little on one side. His moustache was very stiff and military. The neatness of his attire was almost incredible."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ac6e75cc-2851-39a5-a5fd-477d16672e03",
                                        "entry_id": "9ad587ca-ff49-3c6c-87a7-7e773eef42f3",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Relating to armed forces such as the army, marines, navy and air force (often as distinguished from civilians or police forces)."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "Canada",
                                            "US",
                                            "not-comparable",
                                            "usually"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "da4926ef-9388-4d8d-b718-41fa9c1f3a0a",
                                                "sense_id": "ac6e75cc-2851-39a5-a5fd-477d16672e03",
                                                "text": "If you join a military force, you may end up killing people."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "cc558e49-87c4-3077-bfcc-3f3724c14329",
                                        "entry_id": "9ad587ca-ff49-3c6c-87a7-7e773eef42f3",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Relating to war."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "not-comparable",
                                            "usually"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "609dea29-3b5e-4b0c-9f41-1ac4dcbcd149",
                                                "sense_id": "cc558e49-87c4-3077-bfcc-3f3724c14329",
                                                "text": "The only goal pursued by Western defense strategy — to cause the Warsaw Pact to break off an attack — is more military than political in nature."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "4c93a547-f71e-3bba-9d91-3b2c74de196f",
                                        "entry_id": "9ad587ca-ff49-3c6c-87a7-7e773eef42f3",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Relating to armies or ground forces."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "not-comparable",
                                            "usually"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "military",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "62442e2b-fec3-3f5d-b416-3b053255295b",
                                        "entry_id": "1f0e5d23-5fba-39c6-91e1-258ce0d7629a",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Armed forces."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2cd5e9ab-1527-4ec4-bf13-b14242262536",
                                                "sense_id": "62442e2b-fec3-3f5d-b416-3b053255295b",
                                                "text": "He spent six years in the military."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9fa49a8d-09be-466e-be7f-abe33cab7230",
                                                "sense_id": "62442e2b-fec3-3f5d-b416-3b053255295b",
                                                "text": "The dispatches […] also exposed the blatant discrepancy between the west's professed values and actual foreign policies. Having lectured the Arab world about democracy for years, its collusion in suppressing freedom was undeniable as protesters were met by weaponry and tear gas made in the west, employed by a military trained by westerners."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
